## Part 1: Fix the Gateway bug — POST /api/accounts/:id/test should return 404 for account-not-found

**Edit** `packages/core/src/gateway/routes/accounts.ts`

The current code at lines 111-116:
```typescript
  // POST /api/accounts/:id/test — connectivity test
  fastify.post("/api/accounts/:id/test", async (
    req: FastifyRequest<{ Params: { id: string } }>,
  ) => {
    const result = await testAccount(req.params.id);
    return result;
  });
```

Change it to check for account-not-found:
```typescript
  // POST /api/accounts/:id/test — connectivity test
  fastify.post("/api/accounts/:id/test", async (
    req: FastifyRequest<{ Params: { id: string } }>,
    reply,
  ) => {
    const result = await testAccount(req.params.id);
    if (!result.success && result.error?.includes("not found")) {
      reply.code(404);
    }
    return result;
  });
```

